{"words": [{"text": "وَقُلْنَا", "translation": "And We said"}, {"text": "يَـٰٓـَٔادَمُ", "translation": "O Adam"}, {"text": "ٱسْكُنْ", "translation": "Dwell"}, {"text": "أَنتَ", "translation": "you"}, {"text": "وَزَوْجُكَ", "translation": "and your spouse"}, {"text": "ٱلْجَنَّةَ", "translation": "(in) Paradise"}, {"text": "وَكُلَا", "translation": "and [you both] eat"}, {"text": "مِنْهَا", "translation": "from it"}, {"text": "رَغَدًا", "translation": "freely"}, {"text": "حَيْثُ", "translation": "(from) wherever"}, {"text": "شِئْتُمَا", "translation": "you [both] wish"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "But do not"}, {"text": "تَقْرَبَا", "translation": "[you two] approach"}, {"text": "هَـٰذِهِ", "translation": "this"}, {"text": "ٱلشَّجَرَةَ", "translation": "[the] tree"}, {"text": "فَتَكُونَا", "translation": "lest you [both] be"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ", "translation": "the wrongdoers"}], "sahih": "And We said, \"O Adam, dwell, you and your wife, in Paradise and eat therefrom in [ease and] abundance from wherever you will. But do not approach this tree, lest you be among the wrongdoers.\""}